VF-ABT010: unreachable statement after guaranteed exit
Phase: semantic
Location: line 9, column 5
Found: statement after guaranteed exit
Expected: reachable statement
Hint:
Statements after a guaranteed exit cannot execute.

Remove the unreachable statement or move it before the `return`/`abort` path. This check is intentionally simple: a previous `return`, `abort`, or branch shape that exits on all paths ends the current block.
